<section style="padding:96px 24px 40px;"><div style="max-width:860px;margin:0 auto;"><div class="rich"><p>Mount Pearl is St. John's biggest neighbour, and most of it was built in one long push through the 1970s and 80s. The streets off Park Avenue, Commonwealth Avenue, Ruth Avenue and Old Placentia Road went up with an oil furnace in the basement and a steel tank on the side of the house, and plenty of those homes still heat that way. An outdoor single-wall steel tank is only tagged for 10 to 20 years, so if yours is the original or a replacement from the 2000s, the HOST tag is either done or close to it.</p><p>Harbour Tank Co handles <a href="/oil-tank-replacement-st-johns/">oil tank replacement</a>, <a href="/oil-tank-removal-st-johns/">tank removal</a> and <a href="/fibreglass-oil-tank-upgrade-st-johns/">fibreglass upgrades</a> across Mount Pearl, from Topsail Road down to Old Placentia Road and out to the Paradise line. The crew is licensed and insured, every job starts with a free written estimate, and there's a 24/7 line for the day the oil truck pulls away without filling you. Call (709) 800-3117, or keep reading for what the job involves and what it costs.</p></div></div></section>
<section style="padding:0 24px 64px;"><div style="max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;">
    <span class="kicker">What We Do in Mount Pearl</span>
    <h2 class="section-heading" style="font-size:clamp(22px,3vw,32px);margin:0 0 28px;">Services for Mount Pearl Properties</h2>
    <div class="feat-grid" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:20px;">
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #D9E6E6;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(13,44,71,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Open Sans',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:#0E4F5C;margin:0 0 8px;">Oil Tank Replacement</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">A new steel or fibreglass tank set on a proper base at your Mount Pearl home, connected, then tagged and registered by the installer's licensed inspector so your supplier can deliver again. The old tank leaves on the same truck.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #D9E6E6;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(13,44,71,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Open Sans',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:#0E4F5C;margin:0 0 8px;">Oil Tank Removal</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">Switched to a heat pump or electric baseboard and the old tank is still rusting beside the house? We pump out what's left, cap the lines and haul it off your Mount Pearl property, then clean up the pad.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #D9E6E6;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(13,44,71,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Open Sans',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:#0E4F5C;margin:0 0 8px;">Fibreglass Tank Upgrade</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">Fibreglass doesn't rust through the way steel does after 20 Mount Pearl winters, and it can carry a tag good for decades instead of a decade. It's the right pick if you'd rather not do this job twice.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #D9E6E6;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(13,44,71,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Open Sans',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:#0E4F5C;margin:0 0 8px;">Expired Tag and Leak Emergencies</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">Refused delivery or oil on the ground? Our 24/7 line gets a crew moving toward Mount Pearl fast, and we'll talk you through keeping the house warm in the meantime.</p>
      </div>
</div>
